21 CO GOV-004 GOV-010 m=RA | Undefined product behavior or tunable values require approval (GOV-004, GOV-010; inventing user-visible behavior is also forbidden by GOV-003).
22 CD GOV-017 ARC-020~ m=RA k=P st=S c=M | Unclear-case test: any yes (dependency/framework/infrastructure change, boundary change, project-wide convention, observable/contract change, expensive to reverse) makes a decision Reserved — broader than the oracle's approval items.
  t: unclear cases only
